- **Documented behavior**: R18 says a failed first-run check leaves the repo `enabled: false` and reports why; no document says the failure is final.
- **Restrictions honored**: a dry run stays read-only (dispatch.py docstring); an existing store is kept (first_run.py already does this); label creation stays inside `first_run`/`repo_init`.
